runtime/core/shaders/gen_post_data.py compiles eight of the passes
(prepare_inputs, luma_pyramid, shading_change_pyramid, shading_change,
prepare_reactivity, luma_instability, accumulate, rcas) with glslc into
runtime/core/fsr3_data.h, one SPIR-V module per combination of the options
each pass reads. runtime/core/fsr3.c ports the dispatch logic of
sdk/src/components/fsr3upscaler/ffx_fsr3upscaler.cpp (resource sizes and
formats, constant buffers, the ping-pong of history resources, the clears and
the order of the passes) to the runtime's upscaler stage.

